## Context
Child of 1830 (author decisions of 2026-10-01, see 1830). Priority: must merge before the launch of the Opus stage 2 (waiting for the router experiment). The new questions are separate output fields; the ICF wording and the historical prompt (hash of the 4,752 t1530 labels) stay intact: new prompt file, separate append-only dimensions table.

## Exit criteria
- [x] New stage-2 wrapper (distinct versioned file), output with discipline (contribution test), field, contribution type; the historical hash of the t1530 prompt is not modified
- [x] Parser accepts the old and the new format; append-only dimensions table with the same guard as `icf_screen`
- [x] Gold discipline set (100-150 works, stratified ML/data science, pure finance, management), two decorrelated judges + panel arbitration, without the author
- [x] Test on the control set (200) and the sentinels: ICF agreement with the old prompt, discipline agreement with the gold set, cost reported
- [x] `make check-fast` and `make lint` pass
